commit 4f0d628b1f90ce24e9decfc27366f4357b3b451d
Author: Matt Voget <matt.voget@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 7 13:35:51 2026 -0600

    fix(cost): review fixes — resume-safe attribution, pagination, bounded baseline, PR discovery, zero-total guards
    
    - token-usage.sh: mtime-ordered scan (resumed sessions can't fabricate
      pre-baseline spend); prune zero-usage files (baseline stays bounded);
      fenced + paginated recovery; empty-tree → unavailable
    - issue-cost.sh: decode gh --paginate page-per-array output; auto-discover
      linked PRs from the issue timeline; label unpriced metrics rows; all-zero
      stages render unpriced, never $0.00
    - rates snapshot refreshed from kyber's regenerated feed (cache_creation
      rates present — was silently unpriceable fleet-wide)
    - handle-inbound: baseline as its own comment (can't break falcon:pickup);
      report computed in the same block as the completion comment; PR-keyed
      stages recover from the number they posted on
    - CHARTER/CONTRACTS §10 updated to match
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

